  "intro": {
    "title": "One word, four jobs",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Bitte is the busiest polite word in German. It means please when you ask, you're welcome when someone thanks you, here you are when you hand something over, and Bitte? means 'Pardon?' when you didn't catch something."
    ]
  },
